; Spans, origins, diagnostics, arbitrary-precision integers, and the byte
; cursor. This is the root of the production closure, and .ai/asm_plan.md §3.7
; forbids Unix, native pointers, bigarrays, and any C-backed package anywhere
; above it — so the only dependency is the vendored pure-OCaml Fmt.
;
; Melange mode lives in melange/lib/foundation, which copy_files these same
; sources; the two stanzas share this library's name and are made mutually
; exclusive by ASM_MELANGE, because dune cannot make `modes` conditional.

(library
 (name foundation)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries fmt)
 (enabled_if
  (<> %{env:ASM_MELANGE=false} true)))
